  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"69583771-9cc5-4b3e-aff1-e6c5968f7f50\">\n  <p class=\"poem\">When you live in the past,<br>with its mistakes and regrets,<br>it is hard. I am not there.<br>My name is not I Was.</p>\n  <p class=\"poem\">When you live in the future,<br>with its problems and fears,<br>it is hard. I am not there.<br>My name is not I Will Be.</p>\n  <p class=\"poem\">When you live in this moment,<br>it is not hard. I am here.<br><strong>My name is I AM.</strong></p>\n</article>\n",
